{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TJw4L8kI9V1795144073.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平與美國總統特朗普在深圳出席亞太經合組織(APEC)峰會期間，處處展現友好關係，由習近平親自到機場迎接特朗普，到昨日在深圳國際交流中心乘搭扶手電梯時，雙人「伸出援手」、互相扶持上電梯，都反映出兩人關係。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"YMCA.TRUMP.1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fUzBTRhB2D1795144119.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>特朗普離開中國後，白宮特別助理兼通訊顧問馬丁(Margo Martin)於社交平台發布帖文，展示周三歡迎晚宴其中一幕花絮，可見晚宴期間，由中國舞團表演特朗普常於造勢活動播放的經典歌曲《YMCA》。舞團背後的屏幕，展示習近平和特朗普兩人在不同場合會面的合照。習近平與特朗普相鄰而座觀看。</p><p></p><p>馬丁在帖文寫道，總統與習主席一同觀看《YMCA》表演。帖文上載不足一日，已有逾150萬人觀看。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207374-APEC%E4%B8%AD%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%A6%96%E6%89%B6%E6%89%8B%E6%A2%AF%E4%BA%92%E5%8A%A9%E7%8F%BE%E6%BA%AB%E9%A6%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%95%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E5%90%91%E7%BF%92%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E4%BC%B8%E6%89%8B%E7%89%BD%E8%91%97%E6%88%91\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">APEC｜中美元首扶手梯互助現「溫馨一幕」　特朗普向習近平伸手：牽著我</a></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:23:54.928231+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:37:31.976115+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:17:17.469941+00:00","content_hash":"23c03d94f2aac0291c0b6bdc0eef09784913f44df03b6993e03c07a5603a03d4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:23:54.928231+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}